OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear village could
OL,4,Abecome 'giant town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a village in
OL,7,FLeicestershire say they fear it could
OL,8,Fbecome "one giant town" as a housing
OL,9,Fblueprint took another step forward.
OL,11,FBlaby District Council voted on Tuesday
OL,12,Fto send plans for 5,000 homes and
OL,13,Fnearly 50,000 sq m (538,000 sq ft) of
OL,14,Foffice and industrial space between
OL,15,FStoney Stanton and the M69 to the
OL,16,Fgovernment for approval.
OL,18,FThe plans, which could be built between
OL,19,F2025 and 2042, also include new
OL,20,Fcommunity centres, a GP surgery, three
OL,21,Fprimary schools and a secondary school.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
