OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear village could
OL,4,Abecome 'giant town'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Places all over the country are
OL,7,Fgetting bigger but I thought 'surely
OL,8,Fthey won't take all of that land',"
OL,9,Fsaid Daphne Blithe, who has lived near
OL,10,Fland earmarked for building for 30
OL,11,Fyears.
